    "catalog:tags": "wc, toilet, accessible, wheelchair, bathroom",
    "catalog:note": "Accessible WC, lid open: seat 0.48, rim 0.46, pan front 0.75 from the wall. The transfer side and the lever flush are at +x; a mirrored copy keeps flushSide at +x, so mirror it with care. Grab rails are not drawn. The pan is a ring that abuts a rear block at its tangent.",
    "catalog:basedOn": "Approved Document M and BS 8300-2 via the drafting standard key dimensions: seat 0.48, pan front 0.75 from the wall (checked in secondary summaries only, not in the documents); width 0.38 practice, unverified. Port sizes from the drafting standard (BS EN 12056-2 conventions), unverified",
